Z||000003||batboy||07-09-2000||05:20 PM||||You must be talking about the DIS 2.5 engine, in 87 and 88 they used two coil packs to fire the spark plugs. Look at Chapter 13 in the Haynes manual, it was supplement info about the 88 models and includes info about the 87 4 cylinder too. I do know that those coil packs can get weak and have to be replaced occasionally.||||reg||1
